ssure from busy days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what kind of game is this?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well... It\u2019s simply a game where you wait for cats. That\u2019s it. Really.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No controls, no goals, and honestly\u2014no particular reason either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883520/extras/1dfbb062b61e1ebeeeb53ab65725d934.poster.avif?t=1755492253\" width=600 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883520/extras/1dfbb062b61e1ebeeeb53ab65725d934.webm?t=1755492253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883520/extras/1dfbb062b61e1ebeeeb53ab65725d934.mp4?t=1755492253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you\u2019re doing absolutely nothing, the cats quietly come to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, they won\u2019t show up right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truly. For a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cats drift in on balloons, and some show up looking slightly annoyed for no reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do they come? We\u2019re not really sure either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is sit still and watch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet them, and give them a name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you don\u2019t do anything, having someone come to see you\u2014 now and then\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >can feel surprisingly warm on an otherwise dull day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"b